{"articleNo":"1055","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1055&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010전기 대학원(산업및교육) 신입생 추가등록기간안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.01.27","hit":"11227","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> <!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"465\" bgcolor=\"#ffccff\" height=\"32\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">2010학년도 전기 대학원(산업 및 교육) 추가 등록기간 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #191970; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;1. &nbsp;본교 홈페이지에서 합격증 및 고지서를 출력하여 반드시 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #1e90ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">지정된 기간 및&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #1e90ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 등록장소</span><span style=\"COLOR: #808080; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">에서</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 등록절차를 마쳐야 합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 고지서출력방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #339966; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">고지서출력&nbsp;바로가기 클릭 /주민등록번호 입력 /고지서출력</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #8b008b; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;▶</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></font><a href=\"http://onestop.kumoh.ac.kr/ipsi/graduate/graduateHap1.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\">2010 전기 대학원 합격자 발표&nbsp;및 등록금고지서 출력 바로가기</font></span></a><span style=\"COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\">◀</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #1e90ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #1e90ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 등록기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff6600; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 1. 28(목) ~ 1. 29(금) [2일간]</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 등록장소 : 농협중앙회 전국&nbsp;각 지점 (고지서 지참)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ▶ 등록여부 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> : 입금 당일 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">20:00시</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> 이후</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #339966; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">고지서출력 바로가기 클릭 / 주민등록번호 입력</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #009900; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">시&nbsp; 등록여부 확인 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 문의전화 : 054) 478-7014~15</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2.</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff6600; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">등록기간에 미 등록시</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff1493; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">개인별 통보없이</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff1493; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">합격을 취소됩니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 출력되는 고지서는 2009학년도 기준으로 추후 등록금 인상시 추가 납부 금액이 발생 할 수 있습니다.<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 학자금 대출 문의: 1666-5114 (한국장학재단 대표전화)<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 신입생의 경우 등록금 분합납부는 불가합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 1.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원(산업 및 교육대학원)장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
